      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Every Strategy interface follows the SAME shape: one method, multiple impls.\nParkingLot stores each as unique_ptr<T>; injected at construction; never owned by Ticket.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": "425ea62aed9ed7a2",
      "originalText": "Every Strategy interface follows the SAME shape: one method, multiple impls.\nParkingLot stores each as unique_ptr<T>; injected at construction; never owned by Ticket.",
